OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely sunny, dry and warm
OL,6,Fthis morning, just a small chance of
OL,7,Fan isolated light shower or two.
OL,8,FTurning cloudier and somewhat breezier
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon, but likely
OL,10,Fstaying dry. Feeling humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLikely fine and dry this
OL,13,Fevening, but turning increasingly
OL,14,Fcloudy. Rain edging southwards
OL,15,Fovernight, reaching most places by
OL,16,Fmorning with some heavier bursts
OL,17,Fpossible. Feeling warm and muggy.
OL,18,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
