OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloudy and wet at first. Drier
OL,6,Fand brighter by the afternoon but with
OL,7,Fa scattering of showers. Lighter winds
OL,8,Fthan Saturday but still feeling humid.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMostly
OL,11,Ffine, bright to start Monday, becoming
OL,12,Fvery warm. Occasional rain, stronger
OL,13,Fwinds developing later. Cooler by
OL,14,FTuesday, with bright or sunny spells
OL,15,Fand briefly gusty winds. Similar on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
